untime alongside Opus reviewers\\n52f7166 Record STORY-260830-2jylym board state\\nce03b97 STORY-260830-2jylym: STORY-260830-2jylym: structured-errors-cli-envelope-and-exit-codes\\nd1d3ece Update the board Story survey for the number-contract Story\\nccf8f87 Record STORY-260903-1h7ybr board state\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3147,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 787,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
