ide the terminal-backend-registry-and-contract story boundary.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\nProduction behavior demonstrates: Implement closed manifest/probe schemas, generation-bound capability evidence, dependencies, expiry, and fail-closed admission. Exact contract fixtures and negative/refusal cases pass; crash/idempotency evidence is included when the operation mutates durable state; no unsupported capability is advertised.\\n===\\n# TASK-260830-1snnef: build-terminal-backend-conformance-harness\\n\\n## Description\\nProve lifecycle semantics, attach ownership neutrality, ax pane enforcement, replication exclusions, and historical translation. This is an implementation deliverable, not a specification rewrite.\\n\\n## Scope\\nrelux-works/agent-session-manager-spec@v0.5.0 (commit 28bf96d7dd7ebf3cd9e2ccd91d35b8660699dd5c); §4.A-4.1, §6.5, §7.A. Work only inside the terminal-backend-registry-and-contract story boundary.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\nProduction behavior demonstrates: Prove lifecycle semantics, attach ownership neutrality, ax pane enforcement, replication exclusions, and historical translation. Exact contract fixtures and negative/refusal cases pass; crash/idempotency evidence is included when the operation mutates durable state; no unsupported capability is advertised.\\n===\\n57afcc6 Admit muse-spark as the producer runtime alongside Opus reviewers\\n52f7166 Record STORY-260830-2jylym board state\\nce03b97 STORY-260830-2jylym: STORY-260830-2jylym: structured-errors-cli-envelope-and-exit-codes\\nadca16a TASK-260830-33sfxc: prove the error and result compatibility claims\\nf34d91d TASK-260830-1bipsa: implement the CLI Result envelopes\\nebc4e31 TASK-260830-34elja: implement the Structured Error registry\\nd1d3ece Update the board Story survey for the number-contract Story\\nccf8f87 Record STORY-260903-1h7ybr board state\\n041b38b STORY-260903-1h7ybr: STORY-260903-1h7ybr: canonicalize-number-contract\\n4c6ad14 Document Canonicalize's real RFC 8785 number contract and pin it\\n6c690da Update the board Story survey for the ownership-binding Story\\n55f49c6 Record STORY-260903-b48t03 board state\\n30f6528 STORY-260903-b48t03: STORY-260903-b48t03: semantic-ownership-binding\\n2d0962c BUG-260902-2m7slg: make ownership bindings claim their coverage\\nfa06e6d Update the board Story survey for the spec-fidelity Story\\nfb021a0 Record STORY-260902-2xwq38 board state\\n6466943 BUG-260902-3dn8jd: check enumeration excerpts against the pinned SPEC\\nb8a85d4 BUG-260902-3dn8jd: check enumeration excerpts against the pinned SPEC\\nfacbd9a Update the board Story survey for the canonicalization cleanup Story\\nb6af1b1 Record STORY-260902-xpwppu board state\\n===\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3072,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 768,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
