{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cc8f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06e5a-32bc-7443-a1f1-5c57fcb17017"},"sequence":1186,"recorded_at":1780531400002367,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"d4680851-7ee4-46f3-b9ae-940cf14558fc","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"d4680851-7ee4-46f3-b9ae-940cf14558fc","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"d4680851-7ee4-46f3-b9ae-940cf14558fc"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"597d626e-bd67-41a8-bf4a-b5fb5065f315"},"task_id":"597d626e-bd67-41a8-bf4a-b5fb5065f315","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"597d626e-bd67-41a8-bf4a-b5fb5065f315","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3m2mw8/worktree/internal/specdoc/SPEC.md`.\n(2404 line(s) above)\n2405|enabled = true\n2406|health_interval_seconds = 30\n2407|\n2408|[restore]\n2409|auto_resume = false\n2410|\n2411|[profiles.yolo]\n2412|require_first_use_confirmation = true\n2413|~~~\n2414|\n2415|On native Windows, a workspace mapping is written with a quoted TOML string\n2416|such as <code>path = \"D:\\\\Developer\\\\ReluxWorks\"</code>, and terminal backend\n2417|MUST be <code>conpty</code>. WSL2 configuration uses Linux paths and\n2418|<code>platform = \"wsl2\"</code>.\n2419|\n2420|### 6.3 Field constraints\n2421|\n2422|<code>platform</code> is one of <code>macos</code>, <code>linux</code>,\n2423|<code>wsl2</code>, or <code>windows</code>. A peer is authorized only when its\n2424|stable <code>host_id</code> appears in <code>mesh.peers</code> and the SSH\n2425|endpoint resolves to the authenticated host expected by SSH host-key policy.\n2426|Tailscale discovery MAY suggest a candidate configuration but MUST NOT write or\n2427|authorize it automatically.\n2428|\n2429|<code>mesh.payload_encryption</code> MUST be <code>none</code> in v0.3.0.\n2430|Other values MUST fail as unsupported. SSH supplies transport protection; this\n2431|setting prevents a misleading at-rest encryption claim.\n2432|\n2433|<code>sync.chunk_bytes</code> MUST equal 4,194,304 in Configuration 1.0.0.\n2434|Implementations MAY expose the field for forward compatibility but MUST reject\n2435|another value in this protocol version.\n2436|\n2437|Workspace roots MUST have unique <code>logical_root</code> values. Paths MAY\n2438|differ across hosts. A materializer MUST map a workspace using\n2439|<code>logical_root</code> plus a validated relative path, never a source\n2440|absolute path.\n2441|\n2442|The complete v1 field/default contract is:\n2443|\n2444|| Key | Required/default | Constraint |\n2445|| --- | --- | --- |\n2446|| <code>schema</code> | Required | Exact config schema identifier |\n2447|| <code>schema_version</code> | Required | Compatible version negotiated by this binary |\n2448|| <code>host_id</code> | Required | Stable UUIDv7; changing it creates a new mesh host |\n2449|| <code>host_name</code> | Required | 1–64 printable non-control UTF-8 characters |\n2450|| <code>platform</code> | Required | One of the four values above; MUST match runtime probe |\n2451|| <code>mesh.transport</code> | Default <code>ssh</code> | Only <code>ssh</code> in v0.3.0 |\n2452|| <code>mesh.sync_interval_seconds</code> | Default 60 | Integer 5–86,400 |\n2453|| <code>mesh.connect_timeout_seconds</code> | Default 10 | Integer 1–300 |\n2454|| <code>mesh.rpc_timeout_seconds</code> | Default 300 | Integer 10–3,600 |\n2455|| <code>mesh.workspace_replication</code> | Default true | Boolean |\n2456|| <code>mesh.payload_encryption</code> | Default <code>none</code> | Only <code>none</code> in v0.3.0 |\n2457|| <code>mesh.peers</code> | Default empty | Unique host ID and name; endpoint required |\n2458|| <code>mesh.peers[].ssh_args</code> | Default empty | Arg array; MUST NOT disable host-key checks |\n2459|| <code>mesh.peers[].workspace_roots</code> | Default empty | Unique logical roots within peer |\n2460|| <code>workspace_roots</code> | Default empty | At least one matching root required for workspace materialization |\n2461|| <code>providers.plugin_dirs</code> | Default empty | Absolute directories |\n2462|| <code>providers.allow_path_plugins</code> | Default true | Boolean |\n2463|| <code>providers.require_explicit_trust</code> | Default true | MUST remain true unless an enterprise policy supplies equivalent signed trust |\n2464|| <code>sync.chunk_bytes</code> | Default/fixed 4,194,304 | Protocol 1.0.0 constant |\n2465|| <code>sync.max_parallel_chunks</code> | Default 4 | Integer 1–32 |\n2466|| <code>sync.staging_retention_hours</code> | Default 72 | Integer 1–720 |\n2467|| <code>sync.tombstone_min_retention_days</code> | Default/minimum 90 | Integer 90–3,650 |\n2468|| <code>terminal.backend</code> | Platform default | <code>tmux</code> on macOS/Linux/WSL2; <code>conpty</code> on Windows |\n2469|| <code>terminal.safe_boundary_timeout_seconds</code> | Default 300 | Integer 1–3,600 |\n(more lines below)"}}}
