{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d14d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06e5a-32bc-7443-a1f1-5c57fcb17017"},"sequence":1793,"recorded_at":1780531400003581,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"d4680851-7ee4-46f3-b9ae-940cf14558fc","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"d4680851-7ee4-46f3-b9ae-940cf14558fc","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"d4680851-7ee4-46f3-b9ae-940cf14558fc"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — TASK-260830-2xdt8t is handed off to review (`to-review`, checklist 10/10).\n\nWhat was built:\n\n- New `internal/terminalbackend/terminalbackend.go` — the registry production entry point: `ParseID` (canonical grammar + `ax.` reservation), `New` (admits `ax.tmux`/`ax.conpty` with explicit version tuples), `RegisterExternal` (enabled/absolute-path/digest trust, duplicate → `terminal_backend_ambiguous`, drift → `terminal_backend_implementation_drift`, trust failure → `terminal_backend_untrusted`), `Resolve`, `DefaultForPlatform`, `RequireRestoreBinding` (default substitution → `terminal_backend_restore_mismatch`), `CheckVersionTuple`, `CheckProviderDescriptor` (§7.A, generation bound 1..256), `DigestFile`. All six wire codes verified against the pinned catalog vocabulary in-test.\n- `internal/config/validation.go` now delegates backend-ID grammar to the registry and refuses `ax.*` external-trust IDs as ambiguous; superseded local pattern removed.\n- Tests: 14 registry test functions (every gate narrowed, one wire code per refusal proven, duplicate/drift non-clobber idempotency) + config wiring tests including a new legacy-arm pin that v1 `backend=\"tmux\"` on Windows refuses.\n- Board-disclosed findings decided with quoted spec evidence: empty `required_capabilities` default kept (no minimum set is enumerated; inventing one is forbidden), conpty-on-Windows enforced and pinned on both arms but not extended to third-party IDs.\n- Gates, all exit 0, run standalone: `go test ./...`, `go test ./... -cover` (terminalbackend 89.3%, config 94.7%), `go vet ./...`, gofmt clean.\n- One signed commit `b5cf5b5` on the story branch (verified via `git verify-commit`), worktree clean, not pushed; outcome artifact `TASK-260830-2xdt8t_verification-log.md` attached; LOGBOOK.md entry recorded.","reason":null}}
